### ===========================
### USER MODULE
### ===========================

### -------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Ver meu perfil (qualquer usuário autenticado)
### -------------------------------------------------------
GET {{base_url}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### -------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Listar todos os usuários (Admin only) - Paginado
### -------------------------------------------------------
GET {{base_url}}/users?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### -------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Buscar usuário por ID (Admin only)
### -------------------------------------------------------
GET {{base_url}}/users/{{student_user_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### -------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Desativar usuário (Admin only)
### -------------------------------------------------------
DELETE {{base_url}}/users/{{student_user_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### -------------------------------------------------------
### 5. Tentar acessar sem token (deve retornar 401)
### -------------------------------------------------------
GET {{base_url}}/users/me
